5,0,1,talk,Kenji,,Hi everyone! I'm so excited to play this game! Let's all be friends and work together to find the werewolf! Does anyone have a plan?,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shion,,"Let's not be too hasty. Since we have no information, the most logical approach is to observe how everyone speaks and reacts.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,I agree with Shion. We should prioritize evidence over emotion. I'll be watching for any contradictions in our statements.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Servas,,It is a pleasure to meet you all. Let us maintain a spirit of kindness and patience as we uncover the truth together.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Yumi,,"I'm so happy to be here! I agree with Servas, let's be kind! I'll do my best to help everyone!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Shion, you seem really smart! Do you think we should just talk about ourselves first to get to know each other?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shion,,"That could be useful, Kenji. It establishes a baseline for our behavior. I'm simply here to ensure we make the most rational decisions.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,"A baseline is a good idea. However, we must remember that the werewolf will also try to establish a ""normal"" persona.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Servas,,Wisdom often comes from listening more than speaking. I shall listen closely to the harmony of our conversation.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Yumi,,"That sounds lovely, Servas! I'll just be myself and hope we can all trust each other!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Kenji,,"I'll be the most honest person here! I really want us to win! @Ryuji, are you always this serious?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shion,,"@Ryuji's seriousness is an asset. In a game of deception, a cold eye is often more reliable than a warm heart.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,"I prefer to be thorough. @Shion, you seem very confident in your logic. I'll be keeping an eye on that confidence.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Servas,,It is natural for the young to be spirited and the experienced to be cautious. Both are necessary for the village.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Yumi,,"Hehe, Ryuji is just being careful! I think we're all going to be great teammates!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Kenji,,I think we're all getting along great! I'm ready for the first night! Good luck to the Seer!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Shion,,Indeed. Let us see what the first divination brings to light tomorrow.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
22,0,4,pass,Shion,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
23,0,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will spend the night reflecting on today's patterns.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
24,0,4,pass,Ryuji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
25,0,4,talk,Servas,,May the night be peaceful for all of us.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
26,0,4,pass,Servas,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
