35,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"Good morning! I have something really important to say! I'm the Seer, and I checked Shion... and he's the werewolf!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Shion,,"That was a very bold move, Kenji. To reveal yourself and make such a claim on the first day is either incredibly brave or a very clumsy lie.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"This is a critical development. If Kenji is the Seer, the game ends today. If he is the werewolf, he is trying to frame Shion immediately.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Such a shocking revelation so early. Kenji, dear, are you certain of what you saw in your vision?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Oh no! Shion? Really? I can't believe it! But Kenji is so honest, he wouldn't lie, right?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"I'm 100% sure! I saw it clearly! Please, everyone, we have to vote for Shion so we can win!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Yumi, you seem quite surprised. But consider this: why would a werewolf claim to be the Seer so early and target someone as calm as me? It's too risky.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Kenji, if you are the Seer, you've just made yourself the primary target for tonight. Why risk that now instead of gathering more data?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Servas,,"It is true that the Seer usually hides. However, the desire to protect the village can sometimes outweigh the instinct for self-preservation.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Shion, you're being very calm, but Kenji sounds so sure! I don't want to make a mistake, but I trust Kenji!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Ryuji, I just couldn't keep it a secret when I knew who the bad guy was! I want to save everyone!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Shion,,"An emotional appeal. How typical. @Ryuji, you value reason. Does it seem reasonable for a Seer to expose themselves instantly?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"It is unconventional, but not impossible. However, the possibility of a werewolf ""fake-claiming"" Seer to eliminate a non-threatening player is a known tactic.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Servas,,"We must weigh the risk. If we execute Shion and he is innocent, we lose a logical mind. If we spare him, the wolf remains.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"I think we should believe Kenji! He's just a kid, he wouldn't come up with such a scary lie!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Kenji,,Please! Trust me! Shion is the wolf! Let's vote now!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Shion,,"I will accept your judgment, but I warn you: you are making a mistake based on a child's whim.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
52,1,4,pass,Shion,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
53,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"I have analyzed the claims. While risky, Kenji's directness is consistent with his personality. I will vote.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
54,1,4,pass,Ryuji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
55,1,4,talk,Servas,,I shall follow the path of the Seer's guidance.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
56,1,4,pass,Servas,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
